and_Styles","line":3},{"title":"chalk","target":"https://github.com/chalk/chalk","line":5},{"title":"` and render mode postfix `m`) are available under `style.codes`, which returns a `Map` with the open codes as keys and close codes as values.\n\n###### Example\n\n```js\nconsole.log(style.codes.get(36));\n//=> 39\n```\n\n## [256 / 16 million (TrueColor) support","target":"https://gist.github.com/XVilka/8346728","line":102},{"title":"`color-convert`","target":"https://github.com/Qix-/color-convert","line":113},{"title":"ansi-escapes","target":"https://github.com/sindresorhus/ansi-escapes","line":141},{"title":"Sindre Sorhus","target":"https://github.com/sindresorhus","line":145},{"title":"Josh Junon","target":"https://github.com/qix-","line":146},{"title":"Learn more.","target":"https://tidelift.com/subscription/pkg/npm-ansi-styles?utm_source=npm-ansi-styles&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=enterprise&utm_term=repo","line":152}],"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[[11,13],[17,31],[98,100],[106,109],[128,137]]},
